- What's that?
- Why not?

1342
01:30:14.000 --> 01:30:17.231
Okay. Well, then I'll just, uh-
I'll wait for you-

1343
01:30:17.360 --> 01:30:19.540
We- We'll figure it out.
We'll figure it out.

